  "title": "Premium In-Lobby Media Network Coming to 285 Movie Theatres Nationwide in a New Initiative from National CineMedia and Creative Realities",
  "summary": "National CineMedia (NASDAQ: NCMI) (“NCM”), the leading cinema advertising platform in the U.S. and a leading provider of digital signage, experiential solutions, and media network management, and Creative Realities, Inc. (NASDAQ: CREX) (“CRI”), a leading provider of digital media and AdTech solutions, today announced a new partnership to significantly expand and modernize AMC Theatres’ (NYSE: AMC) in-lobby media footprint across 285 locations nationwide.",
